  "summary": "Keyless US federal finance data: national debt, exchange rates, interest rates, revenue and spending.",
  "description": "Dozens of datasets from the Bureau of the Fiscal Service: Debt to the Penny, Monthly Treasury Statement, Treasury reporting rates of exchange, average interest rates on securities, savings bonds, gold reserves and federal spending. Uniform REST query syntax with fields, filter, sort and page parameters.",
